stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> open: citizen submits
  open --> referred: verified OR critical
  open --> removed: admin rejects / unverified 7d
  referred --> acknowledged: authority accepts
  referred --> open: authority redirects
  acknowledged --> in_progress: work started
  in_progress --> resolved: resolved with note
  acknowledged --> resolved: quick fix
  resolved --> closed: community confirms OR 72h
  resolved --> in_progress: 3+ users say still happening
  closed --> [*]
  removed --> [*]
